  "title": "UFP Industries Expands Pallet Manufacturing Network Through Acquisition",
  "summary": "Grand Rapids, Mich. — UFP Industries (NASDAQ: UFPI) today announced the acquisition of the operating assets, including real estate, of Berry Pallets, Inc., a pallet manufacturer based in Waseca, Minnesota for approximately $20 million. The transaction expands UFP Packaging’s pallet manufacturing footprint and strengthens UFP Packaging’s ability to serve customers across the upper Midwest. Berry […]",
